Package: OECDscaleup
Title: Construct OECD Scale-Up High-Growth-Firm Indicators
Version: 0.2.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("OECD", "Scale Up Team", , "scaleup@oecd.org", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Builds the firm-level high-growth-firm (HGF) / scale-up
    indicators used in the OECD Scale Up project from confidential
    national firm microdata, and produces the aggregate tables
    (characteristics, transitions/evolutions, contribution, predictors,
    trade) shared back with the OECD, with the statistics needed for
    confidentiality checks. Also analyses the fastest-growing scalers
    and scalers growing into mid-caps. Builds on previous OECD routines
    written in Stata.
